rooms_desc ({"As you enter the home of Circe you feel the softness of the red velvet rugunder your feet.  On the walls you notice fine artby Monet, Dali, and Picasso.  You feel the need to explore therest of the house.  Steal anything and you die :)","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This room is the most beautiful in all the house.  It is a dedication of love between two beautiful people.  In front of you, you see a large, king size bed with bluesatin sheets and pillows with red long stem roses placed perfectly on top of the sheets.  On the table beside the bed lies a picture frame, you may want to look at it.  On the walls are displayed pictures of the incredibleadventures with Jamie and Alissa.  On a chair across the room lies an old stuffed bear named Benji who watched the placeand makes sure everyone behaves.  Hee hee take a look in the closet won't ya.  \"I love you Wissi, my one and onlytator tot!\"","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","if you are not either Alissa or jamie you shouldn't be here.",0,0,0,0,})
